    <title>The securities finance AI revolution is here</title>
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://www.pirum.com/hubfs/Pirum/Images/favicon.png">
    <meta name="description" content="Over the last 26 years, Pirum has evolved to become a key part of the infrastructure on which securities finance runs. That connectivity – along with the standardized data model underpinning it – has become the basics, the table stakes, the foundation everyone now builds on. The real value today lies in what that foundation makes possible: AI intelligence operating across the complete trade lifecycle, driving an unprecedented level of automation and creating a better securities financing industry for all firms involved.">
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
